  "new_information": [
    "Crosland DZ151012 entry explicitly lists BM125/Boxer100, independently of the DJ151041 BM150XUG/Pulsar entry",
    "Two useful replacement axle photos (silver and gold appearance) inspected, plus distributor DZ and DJ photos; no scale visible",
    "HAYPO Pulsar/Discover listings reuse four exact image files, mostly marketing, so they are not independent confirmations",
    "The short DZ151012 marketplace dimension statement contains an incoherent unit and cannot be adopted",
    "Catalogue collars/bushings mean a bearing designation alone does not determine shaft diameter"
  ],
